### iniciar sesión como admin (ejecutar primero)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tienda.com",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

### iniciar sesión como cliente (Juan Pérez)
# @name loginCliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan.perez@mail.com",
  "password": "cliente1234"
}

### listar todos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/discounts

### descuentos de una categoría (Periféricos)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/discounts?categoryId=674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012347

### crear: 15% en Periféricos durante noviembre y diciembre 2026
POST http://localhost:3000/api/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012347",
  "percentage": 15,
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### ver el descuento aplicado: el teclado (120) queda a 102 en el pedido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCliente.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "productId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f678901234c", "quantity": 1 }]
}

### porcentaje inválido (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012347",
  "percentage": 150,
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### fin anterior al inicio (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012347",
  "percentage": 10,
  "startDate": "2027-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### categoría inexistente (404)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/discounts
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012399",
  "percentage": 10,
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### modificar el porcentaje (reemplazar el id)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/discounts/REEMPLAZAR_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percentage": 20
}

### eliminar
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/discounts/REEMPLAZAR_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}
